  "behavior": [
    "analyzer/acquire locates the owning lock with manifest discovery, then inspects the complete current config once under the shared lock.",
    "A changed owning root or noncurrent config fails; the language client still compares every prepared token/path/context/body/fingerprint before starting LSP.",
    "Existing lease(plan) retains its snapshot reinspection for CLI previews.",
    "XML root hashing is skipped only when no disk cache consumes it; normal enabled caches keep their validation.",
    "ConfigLock explicitly unlocks on drop so duplicate or temporarily inherited file descriptors do not keep a retired lease alive.",
    "IDE API remains 1.12; config/DTO schemas, CLI bytes, locale keys and analyzer pin remain unchanged."
  ],
